  "notes": "Adds major content-container background images and replaces the incompatible Catbox uploader with the dedicated public GitHub image repository. Results can cycle through 1-6 background images sequentially; Tags & Metadata, Summary, and Notes each support one whole-box background image with fit, position, repeat, overlay, and corner controls. Upload for AO3 now commits local images to VeyrStudio/Archive-Of-Our-Own-Images and fills AO3-safe raw.githubusercontent.com URLs automatically. Keeps the 0.1.65 real-AO3 metadata-text and performance repairs."
